---
const { lite = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="product-landing-section product-help-section" aria-labelledby="obsidian-release-title">
  <h2 id="obsidian-release-title">Release notes</h2>
  <p><strong>Version 1.1</strong> refines the existing collection; {lite ? "Lite still contains 32 presets selected from Full" : "Full still contains 128 presets, including all 32 Lite sounds"}. No additional presets are added.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>{lite ? "The selection now matches its Full 1.1 counterparts, including applicable macro, routing, level, and sound-design refinements." : "Selected macro destinations and modulation paths are restored, with revised filter/oscillator routing and output-level, release, and sound-design refinements."}</li>
    <li>Internal Preview tags are removed; category tags, preset names, and musical descriptions are retained.</li>
    <li>A new two-page {lite ? "Lite" : "Full"} manual covers installation, playing, macros, and troubleshooting. It is included in the ZIP and available separately as a PDF on Gumroad.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Updating:</strong> back up important projects and install the versioned 1.1 bank alongside 1.0. Original 1.0 downloads remain available. Some macros depend on note range, velocity, wheel position, or other controls; see the included Version 1.1 Notes.</p>
  <p>Gumroad's listening demos predate 1.1; affected sounds may differ.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .product-help-section { color: #513337; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.78; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 0.85rem 0; }
  li + li { margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  p + p { margin-top: 0.85rem; }
</style>
